{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/虚空穿梭","pageid":8797,"revid":21857,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%99%9A%E7%A9%BA%E7%A9%BF%E6%A2%AD&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%99%9A%E7%A9%BA%E7%A9%BF%E6%A2%AD&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%99%9A%E7%A9%BA%E7%A9%BF%E6%A2%AD&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>虚空穿梭</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.99.9A.E7.A9.BA.E7.A9.BF.E6.A2.AD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"虚空穿梭\"><b>虚空穿梭</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 虚空穿梭.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0e/gj2ploerp0oucx7n74yj88kpsep2o5v.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%99%9A%E7%A9%BA%E7%A9%BF%E6%A2%AD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0e/gj2ploerp0oucx7n74yj88kpsep2o5v.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%99%9A%E7%A9%BA%E7%A9%BF%E6%A2%AD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0e/gj2ploerp0oucx7n74yj88kpsep2o5v.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />虚空穿梭\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，传送至任一[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空投影</font></span></span>]范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内的任意地形格，并可[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]。<br />释放技能后，受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虚空穿梭•锁定\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">虚空穿梭•锁定</font></span></span>]（持续5回合）；及获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"潜能激发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">潜能激发</font></span></span>]和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时空漫游\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时空漫游</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">菲娜塔</span>]释放技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"召唤•虚空投影\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤•虚空投影</font></span></span>]后执行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"待机\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">待机</font></span></span>]，可释放本技能，且受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"时间回溯•锁定\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">时间回溯•锁定</font></span></span>]时，持续回合数改为<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-2 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/40/2gfpcz0gruh7uvz5hjs6kohxsqy1j9d.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-2_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/40/2gfpcz0gruh7uvz5hjs6kohxsqy1j9d.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=